    <string name="background_deferred_xiaomi">Android reports a standby bucket above ACTIVE. The system may defer WorkManager; this does not prove a Xiaomi toggle is off. On Xiaomi/HyperOS, check No restrictions and Background autostart manually.</string>
    <string name="background_deferred_other">Android reports a standby bucket above ACTIVE. The system may defer WorkManager; review the app’s background battery settings.</string>
